<title>USA: Encore Wire sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Encore Wire sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MCKINNEY, Texas 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Encore Wire Corp said on Tuesay its board declared a three-for-two stock split to be paid as a 50 percent stock dividend on its common stock.</p>
<p>The dividend would be payable August 18 to stockholders of record at the close of business on August 11, it said.</p>
<p>Cash would be issued in lieu of fractional shares would be issued in connection with the stock split, Encore said.</p>
<p>Encore makes copper electrical wire for interior wiring.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
